    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sex Clinic 18+</strong> is an edgy adult visual novel where you play as Steven, a private detective going undercover in an elite mental health clinic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place may look luxurious, but it\u2019s rumored to hide some seriously dark secrets \u2013 illegal patient confinement, shady financial dealings, and black-market drug trading.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f8abc0083d23cb2bc92d2b1c21f39540.poster.avif?t=1747066804\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f8abc0083d23cb2bc92d2b1c21f39540.webm?t=1747066804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f8abc0083d23cb2bc92d2b1c21f39540.mp4?t=1747066804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crack the case, Steven will need to dive headfirst into the seductive underbelly of the clinic, giving in to temptations that could either lead him closer to the truth or throw him off track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tangled web of beautiful but dangerous women, Steven finds allies and rivals, all of whom have their own hidden motives. He\u2019ll need to keep his wits about him to stay on task, but sometimes, giving in to desire is the only way forward. Can he keep his cool while navigating a world where every encounter is a mix of danger and attraction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f1579d636be7379a5ff3aaf995e072c3.poster.avif?t=1747066804\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f1579d636be7379a5ff3aaf995e072c3.webm?t=1747066804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086600/extras/f1579d636be7379a5ff3aaf995e072c3.mp4?t=1747066804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>To </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense storyline: Uncover the secrets lurking in this high-end clinic, where luxury and intrigue collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with fire: Give in to the clinic's tempting charms while skillfully pursuing your mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet captivating characters: Cross paths with alluring personalities who could shift the story in surprising ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that matter: Your decisions shape the plot, unlocking unique events and multiple endings.<br><br>Will Steven unravel the clinic\u2019s mysteries while indulging in all its forbidden pleasures? Dive into the world of Sex Clinic 18+ to find out!</p></li></ul>",
